// assets/js/chatbot/suggestions.js
// PNEC Helper Bot v3 — smart suggestion generation.
//
// Two modes:
//   • EMPTY-STATE chips: time + season + user aware, hand-curated
//     because the LLM should never be the bottleneck for the first
//     paint of the welcome screen.
//   • POST-TURN chips: 3 followups generated by a cheap LLM call after
//     the assistant replies. Lives in api.js (generateSuggestions).
//
// v3.6: full PNEC topic library — 50+ questions across 12 categories,
// drawn from PNEC's real programs (NEC, CERT, PACT, Home Ignition Zone
// Assessments, Fire Smart Landscaping, Disaster Ready Block Parties,
// Large Animal Emergency Planning, the annual Safety Fair, ham/CPR/
// first-aid classes, and the homebound/COVID-19 helpline).
//
// Empty state shows 5–6 contextually picked from these. The new
// "Browse all topics" expander shows the full library.

